# --- Real receipts: originals are never committed -----------------------------
# Everything under dataset/real is ignored except the README and the anonymized
# folder, which itself must only ever hold de-identified samples.
dataset/real/*
!dataset/real/README.md
!dataset/real/anonymized/
!dataset/real/anonymized/**
dataset/real/anonymized/originals/
dataset/real/anonymized/**/*.pdf
dataset/real/anonymized/**/*.heic
dataset/real/anonymized/**/*.original.*
